  "<b>Bootstrap</b> — bucket de state e tabela de lock, uma vez por conta.": "<b>Bootstrap</b> — state bucket and lock table, once per account.",
  "<b>Fundação</b> — providers, locals, tags. Aplique: cria zero recursos, mas valida credencial.": "<b>Foundation</b> — providers, locals and tags. Apply: no resources yet, but validate credentials.",
  "<b>Rede</b> — VPC, subnets, NAT. Aplique e confira no console.": "<b>Network</b> — VPC, subnets and NAT. Apply and check the console.",
