  "Trave o provider com <code>~> 5.60</code>: o pessimistic constraint aceita 5.61, mas nunca 6.0 (que quebra tudo).": "Pin the provider with <code>~> 5.60</code>: the pessimistic constraint allows 5.61 but excludes breaking 6.0 releases.",
