  "O <code>filter</code> é a parte difícil: <code>metric.type</code> + <code>resource.type</code> precisam existir de verdade.": "The difficult part is <code>filter</code>: <code>metric.type</code> and <code>resource.type</code> must match actual monitored metrics.",
